tem, and 30 unique skill cards for each character, so total 150 skill cards. <br>-Card game system you may never have seen before anywhere even if similar ones existed. <br>-Support 3 languages from the start, English, Korean, Japanese <br>-Consideration for both casual gamer and hardcore gamer's favorites and game style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/355380/extras/a92b8572c8fe37bf9eba5a940832ffee.avif?t=1791718000\" width=616 height=108 /></span>",
